    "AirTalk does not tolerate objectionable content or abusive users. Harassment, threats, hate speech, sexual content involving minors, spam, impersonation, and any unlawful or harmful conduct are prohibited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk does not tolerate objectionable content or abusive users. Harassment, threats, hate speech, sexual content involving minors, spam, impersonation, and any unlawful or harmful conduct are prohibited."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk does not tolerate objectionable content or abusive users. Harassment, threats, hate speech, sexual content involving minors, spam, impersonation, and any unlawful or harmful conduct are prohibited."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalk is a peer-to-peer chat app. You are responsible for the messages and profile text you share with nearby users. Do not share content that violates these terms or another person's rights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk is a peer-to-peer chat app. You are responsible for the messages and profile text you share with nearby users. Do not share content that violates these terms or another person's rights."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk is a peer-to-peer chat app. You are responsible for the messages and profile text you share with nearby users. Do not share content that violates these terms or another person's rights."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalk はサーバーアカウントを作成せず、チャット履歴をサーバーに保存しません。プロフィールは端末内に保存され、相手と直接接続した場合にのみ相手の端末へ送信されます。設定画面からプロフィールとローカルデータを削除できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk does not create server accounts or store chat history on any server. Your profile is stored on your device and is sent to another device only when you connect directly. You can delete your profile and local data from the settings screen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk はサーバーアカウントを作成せず、チャット履歴をサーバーに保存しません。プロフィールは端末内に保存され、相手と直接接続した場合にのみ相手の端末へ送信されます。設定画面からプロフィールとローカルデータを削除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalk 利用規約 / EULA": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk Terms of Use / EULA"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk 利用規約 / EULA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalk、ネット無しで繋がるの不思議ですね": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wild that AirTalk works without internet"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk、ネット無しで繋がるの不思議ですね"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalkでつながるの不思議ですね": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funny how AirTalk connects us, isn't it?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalkでつながるの不思議ですね"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalkで話そう！インターネットなしで、近くの人とだけチャットできるアプリです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let's chat on AirTalk! It lets you chat with people nearby, no internet needed."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalkで話そう！インターネットなしで、近くの人とだけチャットできるアプリです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirTalkは、同じアプリを入れた人が近くにいるとつながります。このQRコードを相手のカメラで読み取ってもらいましょう。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalk connects you with people nearby who also have the app. Ask your friend to scan this QR code with their camera."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirTalkは、同じアプリを入れた人が近くにいるとつながります。このQRコードを相手のカメラで読み取ってもらいましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App StoreのAirTalkページへのQRコード": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QR code for AirTalk on the App Store"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App StoreのAirTalkページへのQRコード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Storeの購入情報を取得できませんでした。ネットワーク接続を確認してもう一度お試しください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't load purchase information from the App Store. Check your network connection and try again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Storeの購入情報を取得できませんでした。ネットワーク接続を確認してもう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleでサインインすると、近くで出会った相手と、お互いが承認したときだけ話せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with Apple to talk with people you passed nearby, only when you both approve."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appleでサインインすると、近くで出会った相手と、お互いが承認したときだけ話せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleでサインインする準備": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prepare to sign in with Apple"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appleでサインインする準備"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleの利用者識別子、ニックネーム、ひとこと、同意状態を保存します。Bluetooth検出を選ぶと、署名の照合に必要な情報とすれ違いを最大24時間保持します。通知を許可すると配信用の端末トークンを登録します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We keep your Apple user identifier, nickname, introduction and consent choices. If you enable Bluetooth encounters, encounter tokens, proofs and encounters expire within 24 hours. If you enable notifications, we register a device token for delivery."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appleの利用者識別子、ニックネーム、ひとこと、同意状態を保存します。Bluetooth検出を選ぶと、署名の照合に必要な情報とすれ違いを最大24時間保持します。通知を許可すると配信用の端末トークンを登録します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetoothの使用を許可してください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetoothの使用を許可してください"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Bluetooth access in Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetoothの準備を待っています": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetoothの準備を待っています"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for Bluetooth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth処理に失敗しました。一度停止して再開してください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth処理に失敗しました。一度停止して再開してください"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth failed. Turn detection off, then on again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth検出は任意です。位置情報を取得せず、常時の発見や距離は保証しません。強制終了中は検出できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth detection is optional. We do not collect location or guarantee detection or distance. Detection stops when you force-quit the app."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth検出は任意です。位置情報を取得せず、常時の発見や距離は保証しません。強制終了中は検出できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
